# Free-text summarization and sentence-translation vocabulary (issue #1174).
#
# Three concept groups live here. The text_summarization_action role names the
# act of summarizing a text the request itself carries (a paragraph after a
# colon, a line break, or quotes), which is a different act from summarizing
# the running conversation (meanings-intent.lino) or a seeded topic
# (summary-topics.lino), so both of those handlers keep their prompts. The
# compositional_lemma records give the offline sentence translator its everyday
# vocabulary, and the translation_stop_word role names the function words a
# word-by-word rendering leaves out instead of echoing them in the source
# script.
#
# Surface forms are stored the way normalize_prompt renders them, so a
# punctuation-folded cue such as "tl dr" (tl;dr) still matches.

meanings
  text_summarization_action
    defined-by action
    role text_summarization_action
    lexeme en summarize summarise "give me a summary" "tl dr"
    lexeme ru резюмируй резюмируйте "кратко перескажи"
    lexeme hi "सारांशित करें" "संक्षेप में लिखें"
    lexeme zh 总结一下 概括一下
    lexeme es "haz un resumen" "resume esto"
  weather
    grounded-in Q11663
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en weather
    lexeme ru погода
    lexeme hi मौसम
    lexeme zh 天气
    lexeme es tiempo
  nice
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en nice
    lexeme ru приятный
    lexeme hi अच्छा
    lexeme zh 好
    lexeme es agradable
  today
    grounded-in Q3151690
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en today
    lexeme ru сегодня
    lexeme hi आज
    lexeme zh 今天
    lexeme es hoy
  go
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en go
    lexeme ru идти
    lexeme hi जाना
    lexeme zh 去
    lexeme es ir
  walk
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en walk
    lexeme ru прогулка
    lexeme hi सैर
    lexeme zh 散步
    lexeme es paseo
  lets
    defined-by entity
    role compositional_lemma
    lexeme en "let's" "let’s" lets
    lexeme ru давай
    lexeme hi चलो
    lexeme zh 让我们
    lexeme es vamos
  translation_stop_word
    defined-by concept
    role translation_stop_word
    lexeme en
      words "a" "an" "the" "and" "or" "but" "if" "of" "in" "on" "at" "to" "for" "with" "by" "from" "as" "is" "are" "was"
      words "were" "be" "been" "being" "am" "do" "does" "did" "let" "us" "so" "than" "then" "this" "that" "these"
      words "those" "there" "here" "its" "his" "her" "their" "our" "my" "your"
    lexeme ru
      words "и" "или" "в" "во" "на" "к" "ко" "для" "из" "с" "со" "о" "об" "от" "по" "за" "это" "был" "была" "было"
      words "были" "есть" "же" "ли"
    lexeme hi "और" "या" "में" "का" "की" "के" "को" "से" "एक" "है" "हैं" "था" "थे" "ने" "पर" "कि" "हूँ" "हो"
    lexeme zh "的" "是" "了" "在" "和" "或" "一" "吧"
    lexeme es
      words "y" "o" "el" "la" "los" "las" "un" "una" "en" "a" "para" "con" "de" "por" "del" "al" "es" "son" "era" "eran"
      words "sea" "ser" "su" "sus" "mi" "tu" "nuestro"
